# iCloud sync conflict copies. This project lives in ~/Documents, which syncs,
# and a conflict leaves a "<name> 2.ts" beside the original. 35 of them were
# committed once, including stale copies of the auth and session code.
* [0-9].*

# Generated tile pyramids. Reproduce with scripts/make-tiles.mjs, or export them
# from QGIS/GDAL on the machine that holds the survey. They are committed only
# once a site is wired to serve from them; see context.md 8j.
/portal-data/map/*/tiles/
